{"id":"fb7c32a0f0383968","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-maximal-antichain.md","title":"Maximal Antichain","display":"df-maximal-antichain — Maximal Antichain","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-maximal-antichain","aliases":["58-df-maximal-antichain"],"display":"df-maximal-antichain — Maximal Antichain","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-maximal-antichain"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-maximal-antichain</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-maximal-antichain — Maximal Antichain"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,P,\\preccurlyeq\\in V\">\\(A,P,\\preccurlyeq\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}\\)</span> (partial-order predicate; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MaxAntichain}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{MaxAntichain}_S\\)</span> (maximal-antichain predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}maximal\\text{-}antichain} \\vdash \\mathrm{MaxAntichain}_S(A,P,\\preccurlyeq)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\preccurlyeq)\\land A\\subseteq P\\land \\forall p,q\\in A\\;\\left(p\\neq q\\to\\neg\\exists r\\in P\\;(r\\preccurlyeq p\\land r\\preccurlyeq q)\\right)\\land \\forall p\\in P\\;\\exists q\\in A\\;\\exists r\\in P\\;(r\\preccurlyeq p\\land r\\preccurlyeq q)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}maximal\\text{-}antichain} \\vdash \\mathrm{MaxAntichain}_S(A,P,\\preccurlyeq)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\preccurlyeq)\\land A\\subseteq P\\land \\forall p,q\\in A\\;\\left(p\\neq q\\to\\neg\\exists r\\in P\\;(r\\preccurlyeq p\\land r\\preccurlyeq q)\\right)\\land \\forall p\\in P\\;\\exists q\\in A\\;\\exists r\\in P\\;(r\\preccurlyeq p\\land r\\preccurlyeq q)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>In forcing order, compatibility means having a common stronger condition.</li>\n<li>The final conjunct says that <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> is predense, which is equivalent to maximality for an antichain.</li>\n<li>Zorn's lemma shows maximal antichains exist.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Poset}$ (partial-order predicate; see [[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,P,\\preccurlyeq\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Poset}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MaxAntichain}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}maximal\\text{-}antichain} \\vdash \\mathrm{MaxAntichain}_S(A,P,\\preccurlyeq)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\preccurlyeq)\\land A\\subseteq P\\land \\forall p,q\\in A\\;\\left(p\\neq q\\to\\neg\\exists r\\in P\\;(r\\preccurlyeq p\\land r\\preccurlyeq q)\\right)\\land \\forall p\\in P\\;\\exists q\\in A\\;\\exists r\\in P\\;(r\\preccurlyeq p\\land r\\preccurlyeq q)","display":true},{"tex":"A","display":false}],"bytes":1104,"backlinks":[{"id":"accc6d580eff4d8a","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MaxAntichain}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-maximal-antichain]])"},{"id":"e3f03b61d14b0916","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MaxAntichain}_S$ (maximal-antichain predicate, see [[../batch01/58-df-maximal-antichain.md]])"},{"id":"bf58376f8c8725a4","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Poset}\\subseteq V^2$ and $\\mathrm{MaxAntichain}_S\\subseteq V^3$ (see [[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]], [[../batch01/58-df-maximal-antichain.md]])."},{"id":"bb305cc6af2d4262","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MaxAntichain}_S$ (maximal-antichain predicate, see [[../batch01/58-df-maximal-antichain]])"},{"id":"d4593442242f54cd","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MaxAntichain}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch01/58-df-maximal-antichain.md]])"},{"id":"6d19484c6bfee7df","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-825","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-maximal-antichain.md|58-df-maximal-antichain]]（batch01）"}],"outgoing":["d3f859dbdd37f018"]}